WEBVTT

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.230
Don't be so greedy.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:10.400
Thanks to you,...

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.980
we've had to turn
all our fields...

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.190
into carrot fields,
you know.

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.320
What's the matter?

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.200
Oh, it's only snow.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.660
So, this is
the first time...

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.170
you've ever seen snow.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:44.470
Episode#5
KAGATO ATTACKS

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.040
Now, this is what I call
heaven on earth.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.550
Hey! How about a drink?

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.930
No, I don't think so.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.050
Join me, huh?

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:30.980
Wow!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.730
You sure know how
to put this stuff away.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.190
Now, let me remind you,...

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:40.070
I haven't quite forgiven you...
For that incident the other day.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.610
Come on.
Are you telling me...

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.490
You're still upset
about that?

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.490
I'm sorry you couldn't
seduce Tenchi.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.250
You're disgusting!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:55.630
You see, Tenchi and I are
are related by noble blood.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.920
But you are not.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:02.970
It's only been two months
since you two met.

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.720
I, on the other hand,...

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.850
Have know him since
he was this tiny.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.720
He sure was a cutie-pie.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.560
He sure was.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.690
Yes. What's the matter,
Tenchi?

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.950
Do you see the demon?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.570
Hey, Tenchi!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.870
Oh, Grandma!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.240
Did I surprise you?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.830
Yeah, I thought
you were Grandpa.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.260
Oh, Grandma.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:57.610
Ow, it's hot,
hey wait!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:00.980
Tenchi!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.940
I'm coming.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.320
I always hoped
that one day...

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.950
Tenchi and I
would play together.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.450
But now he treats me...

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.080
like I'm some sort
of monster or something.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.540
So, of course
I tease him sometimes.

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.630
You understand,
don't you?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:28.590
Yes, but, darling,
you were a mummy.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.060
Tenchi just doesn't want
to play with a monster.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:33.020
What did you say?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.060
How old are you anyway?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.980
You're wondering why
he treats you like he does?

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.770
I think I know
the problem.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.900
You hag!

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.780
You're over 1,000 years old!

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:47.280
It's annoying to be
seduced by an old hag.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.780
Just look
at my beautiful skin.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.620
Absolutely nothing
like yours.

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:57.750
Well, maybe you've been
soaking too long.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.540
I hate you.
You're so cruel.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.880
Excuse me...

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:10.300
You!

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.100
How long have
you been there?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.770
Are you talking
about Tenchi?

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:17.560
I hope it's O.K. if I make
myself comfortable.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.020
At that moment...

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.230
When I heard that it was
Tenchi who saved me...

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:29.030
when I was about to be
sucked into a black hole--

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.240
When I heard that...

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:35.370
I thought he just might
be my destiny.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.250
Yes, that's
what I thought.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.330
He might be my destiny.

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.790
Here we've just met,...

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.340
And I'm talking to you
like this.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.180
All right.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.970
How long are you going
to stay in the bath?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:54.470
Whew, it's stinky!
It smells like sake.

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.430
Oh, you're
the only one...

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.690
who understands
my feelings.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.830
Well, I finally
found you, Ryoko.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.160
Kagato!

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.410
You pervert!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.760
Ryoko!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.270
What's happening?

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.730
This one's a real one.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:53.160
The infamous brutal
criminal... Kagato.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:57.200
Eternal and most-wanted
criminal, Kagato.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.080
Come out now!
I know you're here!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.500
I said come out!

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.390
Please excuse
my behavior earlier.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.560
I deeply appreciate you
coming out to welcome me.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.180
Ryoko!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.190
However, this one
belongs to me.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:25.520
She is--

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.730
How do I say it delicately--

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:27.480
Incapable...

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.980
Still, she is agile.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.190
I'll bet she's given
you some trouble.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.660
Princess Sasami,
Princess Ayeka,

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.620
Don't you think it's best
we talk someplace private,...

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.080
Where there's no one
to bother us?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.370
Kagato, you're under arrest!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.080
This is a specially
protected area.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.800
Any kind of combative
action is forbidden.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.300
If you involve
any civilian,...

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.260
I'll blast you to bits!

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:56.930
Oh, my. Oh, my.
You really frighten me.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:00.310
I've heard much of your
heroic episodes in the past.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.730
Now I hear
you're overworked...

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.730
and your performance stinks.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.150
I don't wish for you
to misunderstand me.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.950
I've only come here

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.490
To invite you
to my ship, the Soujya,

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.410
A very pleasant place...

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.250
Where we can get
to know one another.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.090
Oh, I see
you have the sword.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.210
But that's the
King's property.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.470
You're going to
hurt yourself like that.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.430
What do you mean?
What King?

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:41.810
You would fight me without
full knowledge of the sword?

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:42.930
All right, then.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.730
Don't waste your life.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.480
Now, just hand me
that sword.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:55.070
Tenchi!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.450
Don't let him have it.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:02.870
Fascinating.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:07.000
And what about that boy
interests you so much, Ryoko?

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:10.880
Ryoko!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.460
What are you doing?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:17.970
It is said that sword...

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.140
Holds the greatest energy
in the universe.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.260
But the sword will only
release that energy...

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.430
when held by
a suitable owner.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.060
My question is, are you
that suitable owner?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.730
Maybe I am!
I don't know!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.310
I'll ask you again.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.990
Are you a suitable
owner of that sword?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.320
Release her!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:38.780
Let Ryoko go!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.530
Tenchi, no!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.010
Come...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.760
I'll test you.

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.160
This is no fun.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.870
Do you enjoy making me
waste my time?

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.510
Are you playing
with something...

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.130
that doesn't
belong to you?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.090
Grandfather.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.930
Come, Ryoko.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.760
I'll give you
one more chance.

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.190
There you are,...

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.650
the first crown prince
of Jurai's royal family!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.440
Could you show me the
secret of the universe?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:58.110
Will you share
that treasure?

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.740
Pleasure?

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.070
Well, I do know...

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:03.070
Of a comfortable
hot spring nearby.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.870
Well, aren't we cocky?

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:15.420
The greatest energy
in the universe?

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.880
There's no such thing,
and if there were,...

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.090
it couldn't be
controlled by humans.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.260
I have journeyed through
sea after sea of stars...

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.510
in order to find the secret.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.520
What will it take
to get that power?

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.600
Jurai Royal family's power?

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.850
Ryoko!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.860
Using a woman as your shield?

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.280
Ryoko, wake up!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.450
Don't kill her,
Grandpa!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.520
What are you doing?
Have you given up?

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.200
It's not yours, eh?

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.830
I see.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.460
Then this boy
is your...

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.500
Successor.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.420
Tenchi.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.630
Ryoko!

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:31.180
I will take your precious
Ryoko with me.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.810
Improve your skills,
then come to us.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.470
I'll be waiting for you.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.650
You're my brother!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.270
You're my brother
Yosho, aren't you?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.280
Sorry, I--

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.280
I guess
now you know.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.650
But why?

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.990
Tell me!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:50.740
Easy, now.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:52.660
Don't scold me.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.460
That handsome brother--

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.290
What happened to him?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.710
You've changed so much, and...

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.420
--you're older.

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:10.840
Ayeka.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:14.010
I was not going
to tell you this,...

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.970
but if I had stayed
on planet Jurai,...

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:18.560
there would've been a
conflict between you and me...

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.640
over succession
to the throne.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:24.900
You see, my mother
was an Earthling,...

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.280
and I am, too.

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.400
Or at least half of me.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.610
But why should
that matter?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.490
Our father
made the law...

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.250
That after him...

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.870
We should mix with the
blood of other planets.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:44.880
It was a law that many
Juraians didn't like.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.170
In those days, there was
tremendous prejudice.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.470
I--I could not bear it.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:54.180
So when we were
attacked by Ryoko,

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:56.140
I left to fight,
never to return.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.470
Now this planet
is my home,...

00:15:59.470 --> 00:16:02.390
and this is where
I wish to be buried.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:05.060
I have no intention...
of returning to Jurai.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.820
But without Jurai,...

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.280
without its life
tree and water...

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.650
I will die.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.320
I know that, Ayeka,...

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.240
and such a thing
doesn't matter.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.200
Someday
you will understand.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.790
Then it's true, Grandpa.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.500
You're Yosho,...

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.660
Then the legend...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.370
all of it is true.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:28.340
Yes, and you are Crown Prince...
of planet Jurai.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:29.670
You look surprised.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:31.880
But you never
said a thing.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.550
And if I had,
what then?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:36.050
Would you have
known what to do?

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:37.800
Silly boy!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.520
Now is your time
to grasp the future!

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:42.890
I am sorry.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.060
I had no idea your heart
was set on me.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.190
I've got an idea.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:48.400
We could
get married now.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.570
What do you think?

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.980
Brother, please.
Don't make fun!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.400
You're right.
You're right.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.780
I'm too old.
But Tenchi, however,...

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:56.990
is about
the right age.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:59.450
He's a very good Grandson.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.660
And you two
are perfect together.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:12.460
I'm so moved!
I'm so moved!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.300
I'm sorry,...

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.720
But it's so touching,...

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.220
I can't help myself.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:23.020
Grandpa, I have to
save Ryoko, but...

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.060
But she's the cause
of all our trouble.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.400
You certainly don't
have to save her.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.860
Tenchi, I will
give you that sword.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:34.440
Kagato is
very dangerous.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.240
You must go
and defeat him.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:39.070
In order to get hold
of the secret treasure,...

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:41.950
Kagato would think nothing
of destroying this planet.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:44.200
But can I
defeat him?

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.120
I don't know,
Grandpa.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.630
I have a hard enough time
handling that sword.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.290
With that kind
of attitude,...

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.250
how do you expect
to protect these women?

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:55.720
You have a power that
hasn't been awakened yet.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.550
Trust yourself.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.260
Grandpa...

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.390
I understand.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.140
No, Tenchi.
You shouldn't!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.020
Ayeka!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.940
Listen now. For every man,...

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.230
There's a time
when he must fight.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.480
But...

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:20.530
Please, Tenchi,
watch out!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:30.920
The sword has acknowledged
Tenchi as its true owner.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:37.970
Are you going, Tenchi,...

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.220
With the sword you
can't quite handle yet?

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.390
Even so,... are you
still going?

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:49.520
Ryoko... I must save her.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.690
Tenchi, I'll go with you.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.110
I'll go with you, too.

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:55.690
Thank you.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.690
As a member of
the Galaxy Police,...

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.320
it is my duty.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:01.280
Sis, you'll come,
won't you?

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.370
I don't know.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.660
Ayeka, please
take care of Grandpa.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.790
O.K., how are we
going to get there?

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.540
Huh?

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.210
He must see something.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.340
Let's go, Tenchi.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.630
O.K.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:19.670
Ayeka?

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.300
Ayeka!

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.900
What's the matter
with him?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.750
My little Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.220
Oh, my! That poor
little creature.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:01.880
What do we do?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.510
Oh, Ryo-Ohki.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.850
Well, I guess...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:10.310
We can go after him
using this.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:24.870
Here they come, the fools.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.280
It's strange.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:28.330
They're coming here to
throw away their lives...

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:30.500
to save someone
as defective as you.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.540
I am not your
machine anymore.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.210
I am a human being!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.880
Human being?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.380
When compared to the infinite
will of the universe,...

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.970
human feelings amount to
little nothing more than dust.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:46.640
Your current
form was chosen...

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.180
only because
it was convenient.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:49.810
Your original form
could've been...

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.230
anything that I wanted...
Like a stone.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.730
Shall I turn you
into a stone?

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:56.980
Would that
make you happy?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.110
I'd love to
stay and chat,...

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.860
but I'd better prepare
to welcome our guests.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:09.580
If you lay your
dirty hands on Tenchi,...

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.330
you'll be sorry!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.040
I swear it!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.300
Kagato's ship is
about to attack.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:29.930
Avoid it.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.850
Well, believe me,
I'd like to,

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:33.680
But I really don't
know what I'm doing.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:45.650
Ryo-Ohki, attack!
I command you!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:48.410
Oh, I cannot
operate this ship.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.710
Oh, how pretty.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.960
Excuse me over there.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.670
What do you think
you are doing?

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:05.800
This one is different
from all the others.

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.090
So what might this be?

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:10.800
How should I know!
I command you to figure it out!

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:18.310
I am the one who built the
ship that you are in.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:23.780
I can anticipate every
possible move you make.

00:22:29.570 --> 00:22:32.160
Damn him!
It's hopeless!

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:44.550
What's happening?

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:46.760
Maybe the balancer
was hit.

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:56.600
What are you doing?

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.350
This happens to be
a computer unit!

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:00.440
Yeah, well,...

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:03.270
I just don't have
very much to do.

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:12.280
Impressive!
A very nice evasion tactic.

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.410
I wonder if it's due
to the boy's sword.

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:19.080
Ayeka, can we attack
from your ship?

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:21.120
It is possible,

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:22.750
But I'm not sure...

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.420
this ship is fully
formed yet.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:25.420
It's dangerous.

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:28.720
We can't just sit here
and do nothing.

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:30.220
I will go.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:31.260
No. You can't.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.930
All of this is my fault.

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:35.640
But, Tenchi!

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:38.100
Once I get there, you'll
have to direct me!

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.150
Ayeka, I'm ready.

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:50.610
First you must open
the Light-Hawk wings.

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:52.410
Light-Hawk wings?

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:54.570
It's the shield
for that craft.

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.620
It's a defensive system.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.120
But, you can also
use it to attack,...

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:00.710
However, it isn't meant
in that way...

00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:02.870
so we will become vulnerable.

00:24:04.380 --> 00:24:05.750
Not sure what you're saying.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.670
How do I open
the wings, Ayeka?

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:10.970
Tell me what to do!

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:25.810
Ah, they're using
the Light-Hawk wings.

00:24:25.980 --> 00:24:27.440
I'm very impressed.

00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:28.940
Jurai's royal family
is powerful indeed,

00:24:28.940 --> 00:24:31.610
But I have
a suitable strategy.

00:24:37.370 --> 00:24:38.790
Tenchi, please hurry!

00:24:59.970 --> 00:25:01.980
Go!

00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:53.530
Tenchi!

00:25:58.870 --> 00:26:01.240
No!

00:26:19.930 --> 00:26:24.680
Tenchi!

00:26:25.350 --> 00:26:27.440
Where are you?

00:26:46.660 --> 00:26:48.160
Kagato...

00:26:48.410 --> 00:26:52.750
You have stolen the one that
was most precious to me,...

00:26:53.550 --> 00:26:55.550
and I will make you pay.

00:26:58.930 --> 00:27:01.340
You will pay!

00:29:10.010 --> 00:29:11.060
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:29:11.060 --> 00:29:15.400
Kagato created me and took
everything from me.

00:29:15.770 --> 00:29:18.730
Now he's even taking
Tenchi away.

00:29:19.270 --> 00:29:21.280
After a long dark night...

00:29:21.530 --> 00:29:24.240
I finally found this
kind of feeling.

00:29:25.070 --> 00:29:28.780
But Kagato, you try to...

00:29:29.700 --> 00:29:33.330
Tenchi Muyo Episode #6
WE NEED TENCHI!

00:29:34.120 --> 00:29:37.040
Tenchi, I can't live
without you on this planet.

00:29:37.040 --> 00:29:39.790
WE NEED TENCHI!
